Package: softglowos-obs
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kevin Schmidt <https://github.com/kevinschmidt777/softglowos>
Homepage: https://softglowos.com
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: softglowos-base, softglowos-drivers, obs-studio (>= 33), python3, vainfo,
 vlc-plugin-base, @SHLIBS@
Description: OBS Studio set up for SoftglowOS
 OBS from the OBS team's PPA (Ubuntu's has no browser source), prepared on the
 first start (encoder for the graphics card, the mixer as audio, remote control
 for the Stream Deck), plus the plugins of the Bazzite image: Move Transition,
 Source Record, Source Clone, Shaderfilter, Composite Blur, Advanced Masks,
 Stroke Glow Shadow, Game Capture (obs-vkcapture) and DroidCam.
